    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Once upon a time, common dwarf enters to the Elvish Bar.&quot;\u00a0\u00a0<br>This is a story about a Dwarf and his legacy. After you inherited a dwarven tavern, you found that almost everything was destroyed by elves and other fantasy inhabitants. And most importantly, the machine for producing the legendary dwarven ale was dismantled!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take back what is rightfully yours from those who have no honor and no ale.<br><br>Features<br>-Generated levels<br> -\u0441haracter leveling<br>-Randomised abilities,bonuses and weapon with upgrades<br>-nice loot gameplay<br>-different characters<br>-adventure about dwarf<br>-Home bar upgrade system<br>-3d pixel art</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Once upon a time, common dwarf enters to the Elvish Bar.&quot;\u00a0\u00a0<br>This is a story about a Dwarf and his legacy. After you inherited a dwarven tavern, you found that almost everything was destroyed by elves and other fantasy inhabitants. And most importantly, the machine for producing the legendary dwarven ale was dismantled!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take back what is rightfully yours from those who have no honor and no ale.<br><br>Features<br>-Generated levels<br> -\u0441haracter leveling<br>-Randomised abilities,bonuses and weapon with upgrades<br>-nice loot gameplay<br>-different characters<br>-adventure about dwarf<br>-Home bar upgrade system<br>-3d pixel art</p>",
    "short_description": "Return Dwarven ale legacy Brawler-action with roguelite elements about Dwarf adventures through fantasy taverns. Loot, fight and upgrade.",
